# 🛡️ Cyber Security Analytics Dashboard

A comprehensive Cyber Security Analytics Dashboard built with Streamlit for analyzing cybersecurity datasets, generating visual insights, and exploring attack trends through interactive dashboards.

---

## 🚀 Features

### 📊 Data Analytics

* Automated ZIP file extraction
* Data preprocessing and cleaning
* Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
* Statistical summaries

### 📈 Interactive Visualizations

* Distribution Analysis
* Correlation Heatmaps
* Attack Type Analysis
* Threat Trend Monitoring
* Category-wise Comparisons
* Time-Series Security Insights

### 🎯 Dashboard Components

* KPI Cards
* Interactive Charts
* Filters and Search
* Downloadable Reports
* Real-Time Analytics Interface

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
cyber-security/
│
├── archive.zip
├── README.md
├── requirements.txt
│
├── data/
│   └── extracted_files/
│
├── visuals/
│   ├── attack_distribution.png
│   ├── correlation_heatmap.png
│   └── threat_analysis.png
│
├── main/
│   └── app.py
│
└── notebooks/
    └── analysis.ipynb
```

---

## 🛠️ Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/cyber-security.git
cd cyber-security
```

### Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

### Activate Environment

Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

Linux/Mac

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## ▶️ Run Application

```bash
streamlit run main/app.py
```

Application will be available at:

```text
http://localhost:8501
```

---

## 📦 Required Libraries

```text
streamlit
pandas
numpy
matplotlib
seaborn
plotly
scikit-learn
```

