## 🔧 Troubleshooting

### ZIP File Not Found

Ensure the repository structure is:

```text
cyber-security/
│
├── archive.zip
└── main/
    └── app.py
```

Use:

```python
import os

BASE_DIR = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))

zip_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, "..", "archive.zip")
```

instead of hardcoded paths.

